    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician on Neginoth, A Psalm or Song of Asaph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In Judah is God known:",
          "His name is great in Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In Salem also is his tabernacle,",
          "And his dwelling place in Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There brake he the arrows of the bow,",
          "The shield, and the sword, and the battle."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou art more glorious and excellent",
          "Than the mountains of prey."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The stouthearted are spoiled, they have slept their sleep:",
          "And none of the men of might have found their hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "At thy rebuke, O God of Jacob,",
          "Both the chariot and horse are cast into a dead sleep."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou, even thou, art to be feared:",
          "And who may stand in thy sight when once thou art angry?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou didst cause judgment to be heard from heaven;",
          "The earth feared, and was still,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When God arose to judgment,",
          "To save all the meek of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Surely the wrath of man shall praise thee:",
          "The remainder of wrath shalt thou restrain."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Vow, and pay unto the LORD your God: Let all that be round about him",
          "Bring presents unto him that ought to be feared."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He shall cut off the spirit of princes:",
          "He is terrible to the kings of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
